icks to nose manuals.\n- Super accurate physics - as close as you'll get to real BMX without picking up a bike.\n- Amazing controls allow full creativity, from floaty 360s to frontflip bikeflips.", "contentAdvisoryRating": "4+", "trackCensoredName": "Pumped BMX 2", "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/kr/app/pumped-bmx-2/id893141226?uo=4", "bundleId": "com.yeahus.pumped2", "averageUserRating": 5, "genres": ["게임", "스포츠", "레이싱"], "userRatingCount": 7}]}